  "description": "GameFrameX.Capability.Online.Match,GFX Online 对局能力包:权威对局 Actor/同步协议/重连/幂等结算/样例玩法与撮合成立通知出站端口(InMemory 默认存储,描述符服务面 Override 替换)+ admin handlers(end_abnormal_match). Match capability package for the GFX Online family: authoritative match actor, sync protocol, reconnect, idempotent settlement, the sample game and the match-made notification outbound port with in-memory default stores and admin handlers. Documentation: https://gameframex.doc.alianblank.com",
